    "work_id": "anf-works/victorinus-on-the-creation-of-the-world",
    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "as is contained in the book of Moses, which he wrote about its creation, and which is called Genesis.",
