    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.4.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Moreover, the seven heavens agree with those days; for thus we are warned: “By the word of the Lord were the heavens made, and all the powers of them by the spirit of His mouth.”",
