    "work_id": "anf-works/victorinus-on-the-creation-of-the-world",
    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.4.s10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "There are seven spirits. Their names are the spirits which abode on the Christ of God, as was intimated in Isaiah the prophet:",
