    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.4.s11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "“And there rests upon Him the spirit of wisdom and of understanding, the spirit of counsel and might, the spirit of wisdom and of piety, and the spirit of God’s fear hath filled Him.”",
