    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.4.s13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "From this, therefore, the thunders bellow, the lightnings are kindled, the fires are heaped together; fiery darts appear, stars gleam, the anxiety caused by the dreadful comet is aroused.",
