    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.4.s19",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Therefore this Word, when it made light, is called Wisdom; when it made the sky, Understanding; when it made land and sea, Counsel; when it made sun and moon and other bright things, Power;",
