    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.6.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Who, then, that is taught in the law of God, who that is filled with the Holy Spirit, does not see in his heart, that on the same day on which the dragon seduced Eve, the angel Gabriel brought the glad tidings to the Virgin Mary;",
