    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.6.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I have also set forth His humanity to the Jews in these manners: since He is hungry, is thirsty; since He gave food and drink; since He walks, and retired; since He slept upon a pillow;",
