    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.6.s10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "since, moreover, He walks upon the stormy seas with His feet, He commands the winds, He cures the sick and restores the lame, He raises the blind by His speech,—see ye that He declares Himself to them to be the Lord.",
