    "canonical_ref": "Victorin.Fabr.7.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "The day, as I have above related, is divided into two parts by the number twelve—by the twelve hours of day and night; and by these hours too, months, and years, and seasons, and ages are computed.",
